Z||000006||Kevin-84SE||08-24-2001||11:27 PM||||All of the Fiero's were made in the plant in Pontiac Michigan, I took a tour of it in July of 1985. I wish they would have let us bring cameras in but then I am sure they would not have shown us the fastbacks that were top secret at that time. I did enjoy the tour a great deal, they had the first Fiero off of the assembly line on display.<P>   Kevin||||reg||7
